Package: Final
Title: Package that allows work with NOAA Earthquake Data
Version: 1.0.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "J",
                  family = "W",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "sample@example.com")
Description: A package developed for the Coursera Mastering Software 
    Development in R Capstone. It cleans raw NOAA significant earthquake 
    data, builds custom chronological timelines via ggplot2 extensions, 
    and generates interactive geospatial distribution maps using leaflet..
